+---
+id: task-003-restore-welcome-coupon-after-cancellation-and-free-delivery-at-50
+type: task
+title: "Restore welcome coupon after cancellation and free delivery at €50"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Paolo's cancelled order must release its single-use welcome coupon so a corrected order can use it.
+Review the free-delivery report at the €50.00 boundary and retain or add regression coverage that
+confirms shipping is free when discounted goods are exactly €50.00 before VAT.
+
+Acceptance criteria:
+
+- Cancelling a confirmed order returns the single-use coupon reserved by that order.
+- A corrected order can redeem that coupon after cancellation, including on the same calendar day.
+- Goods totalling exactly €50.00 after discounts ship free.
